  "title": "Legally ending a marriage, separation and divorce",
  "highlighted": false,
  "category": "Relationships",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">This page outlines where to get information on the different ways relationships can be legally ended in Ireland — including divorce, separation, civil partnership dissolution, and annulments.</p>",
      "id": "6a1853c6-0b31-46f9-b667-1e02c53dcdb5"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Applying for divorce",
      "id": "78b0308c-4b37-4155-a0f0-db8480e78ccf"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">A step-by-step guide to applying for divorce, including how to file a Civil Bill and what forms you need, is available on <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/how-to-apply-for-a-divorce\">the Courts Service website</a>.</p>",
      "id": "f946c74c-1908-45e2-b3fc-ca9c512461a6"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Understanding divorce",
      "id": "9af88ed2-7e92-4b10-841c-05e279b26842"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Get <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/understanding-divorce\">information on what you need to think about when getting divorced</a>.</p>",
      "id": "7a024cf0-9b16-42e1-8a8e-9a4f4ef8aa62"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Reply to a Civil Bill",
      "id": "77440ba2-70cd-4549-a20c-1e6d38dd5334"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Get <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/respond-to--divorce-papers\">information on what to do next if you have received divorce papers</a>.</p>",
      "id": "84a33b05-ea58-4335-ac77-7da5a9c4d5f5"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Judicial separation",
      "id": "299ae143-a6db-4026-bbf0-5e061ff765f4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Learn <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/judicial-separation\">how to apply for a judicial separation</a>, what the process involves, and where to get legal support.</p>",
      "id": "dd0cb216-8bc7-401a-8486-5d0811823896"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Separation agreement",
      "id": "2345e36a-9eb6-45a2-9172-5f167c50cc7e"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Understand what separation agreements are, when to use them, and how to make one legally binding. More information is available on <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/separation-agreement\">the Courts Service website</a>.</p>",
      "id": "2ce7c871-75ac-4e06-92c9-dc40e7108c38"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "End a civil partnership",
      "id": "e53be2b1-c524-4592-9ae7-0129d6ea77ca"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Find out <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/end-a-civil-partnership\">how to apply to the court for a Decree of Dissolution</a> and what else you may need to consider.</p>",
      "id": "b358d4c9-b7dd-4149-94ac-931224a5c8c6"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Annulments",
      "id": "8d906086-d8d9-445e-a6ce-a3014b86bfcb"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Annulments are legal declarations by a court that a marriage or civil partnership never existed. They can only be granted in specific circumstances.</p><p data-block-key=\"1cd8k\">More information is available on <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/guides/annulments-(nullity)\">the Courts Service website</a>.</p>",
      "id": "a92e6d62-b72b-42f5-9a2c-3de148558091"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "value": "Mediation, legal advice and support services",
      "id": "96abc994-c0ed-4967-9927-e97ce8caaf0a"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p data-block-key=\"xuabx\">Information about mediation, legal advice and representation, and where to find a mediator or solicitor, is available on <a href=\"https://www.courts.ie/hubs/legal-supports-and-mediation\">the Courts Service website</a>.</p>",
      "id": "f5d60a2d-cdad-4692-b9c5-0c6598aeab8b"
    }
  ],
